  },
  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce cauliflower",
    "200 gram cucumber",
    "1 tablespoon soy sauce (or coconut aminos)",
    "6 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "2 tablespoon unseasoned rice vinegar",
    "1/2 medium avocado",
    "5 whole nori sheets",
    "5 ounce smoked salmon (or seafood of choice)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a food processor, rice the cauliflower in batches, taking care not to overprocess it.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/IMG_5226.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut the ends off of the cucumber and slice the outer edges into thin strips, discarding the middle portion. Set aside in the fridge to cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/IMG_5232.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the cauliflower rice to a pan over high heat, adding the soy sauce as it cooks.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/IMG_5241.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the cauliflower is cooked and has dried out some, add it to a bowl along with the cream cheese and rice vinegar. Combine well, being careful not to mash the cauliflower completely, and set aside in the fridge until cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/IMG_5252.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the rice mixture has cooled, halve and pit the avocado, leaving the skin on. Carefully slice the meat into thin strips and scoop them out with a spoon.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/IMG_5255.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a nori sheet down on a bamboo mat covered with plastic wrap to keep it from sticking. Spread the cauliflower rice mixture thinly over the nori sheet, leaving about 3/4\" of space at the top.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/IMG_5256.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the cucumber strips, avocado, and smoked salmon on top of the cauliflower rice mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/IMG_5271.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll the sushi tightly and slice. Repeat with any remaining nori sheets.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/IMG_5272-64.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sushi/#wprm-recipe-51925-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
